# The intent corpus (harm-intents.jsonl) IS committed. That was a deliberate
# decision: you cannot regression-test a content filter without the content, and
# a corpus nobody can clone is not an asset. See SCHEMA.md for what it contains
# and why the repository must stay private.
#
# Ad-hoc runs and scratch output are not committed.
baseline-*.jsonl
scratch-*.jsonl
*.tmp.jsonl
